 "script": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Drones sank a ship in NATO waters. Eleven sailors are missing. Who sent them?"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "text": "Overnight, drones hit two cargo ships about thirty kilometers off Bulgaria's coast. One, the Dignity, sank. Reuters reports five crew rescued and eleven missing. The other ship, the Chelsea 3, was damaged. All fifteen of its crew survived."
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
   "text": "Bulgaria's prime minister, Rumen Radev, called it absolutely unacceptable. He has no clear evidence of who did it, he said, but the result favors Russia. Ukraine blames Russia outright. Russia's ambassador said she had no information, and did not rule out a provocation."
  },
  {
   "id": "f3",
   "text": "A week earlier, drones sank another ship in Bulgarian waters. Ten sailors were lost. Radev has asked NATO and the EU for help. NATO chief Mark Rutte says the alliance will adjust its defenses. EU leaders discuss it this week."
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Will NATO step up patrols in the Black Sea? Yes or no?"
  }
 ],
